title: "SELFGuard: Experimental prompt-risk and behavioral-drift signals for prompt-injection detection"
type: software
version: 0.2.0-rc.1
authors:
  - family-names: "Shayan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/shayanscripts/selfguard"
