abstract: >-
  An exploratory Python release candidate for measuring prompt risk before
  generation and behavioral drift in language-model responses. The evidence
  is based on already-inspected development benchmarks and should not be
  interpreted as a production security guarantee.
keywords:
  - prompt injection
  - language models
  - AI safety
  - behavioral drift
